{
  "slug": "atlanta-marathon",
  "title": "Run50 #第7州｜佐治亚：亚特兰大马拉松｜跑过奥运五环",
  "page": "/run50/wechat/atlanta-marathon-modern-rail.html",
  "status": "pending",
  "entry_fix": false,
  "intro": "Run50 第7州来到亚特兰大：96奥运、可口可乐、CNN、城市坡道，以及我和47各自的26.2与13.1。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/us-light-c436d11a43679037.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-zh-index-atlanta-cn-flat.jpg?v=20260630-round4-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我有一个越南朋友叫Ethan, 长得巨像芝芙，大家平时玩的挺好。Ethan在宝岛台湾读的博士，会讲一点点中文，也是当地社群有名的跑步健身达人，他一直说想去跑个亚特兰大马拉松，因为他的好朋友在那里，可以顺便来个tour，这也让我提起了兴趣，所以就顺手查了一下这个松，看着确实还不错！<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">96</strong>奥运之城，王军霞，可口可乐，CNN，标签不少，时间也刚好，不墨迹，瞬间就报了名。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>后来Ethan因为找工作太忙，没去成，不过这对我们来说，一点都重要，有他没他都一样，重要的是有了这么一点点的理由，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">激起了我和47跑亚特兰大的浪花</strong>，然后就是周末两天来回16个小时的自驾，和一段关于26.2和13.1的亚特兰大城市徒步观光游。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "Chattanooga Tennessee @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 001"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>单程8个小时的自驾并没有让我们感到多疲劳，中途我们还去了田纳西州的查塔努加转了一圈，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">放了个飞机</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "Chattanooga Tennessee · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 002"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我们到亚特兰大的时候，已经傍晚了，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">47</strong>去找停车位，我就火速赶往Expo领取跑步装备，马拉松博览会在亚特兰大水族馆，我到的时候很多展位都收摊了，不过最后还是顺利的拿到了我和47的跑步T和号码牌。然后顺利汇合，一起去吃了韩餐之后，回去休息，准备明天的跑步。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "Expo @47",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 003"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "跑马， 96奥运之城"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🎽 Atlanta, Georgia</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>亚特兰大是佐治亚州的首府，42万人。1996年7月28日亚特兰大奥运会女子5000米决赛，中国选手王军霞获得冠军，成绩：<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">14分59秒88</strong>，她也成为了中国第一位获得奥运会长跑金牌的运动员。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>亚特兰大马拉松赛是由<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Atlanta Track Club</strong>举办的，全称是“Publix Atlanta Marathon”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "Atlanta Marathon @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 004"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>亚特兰大Publix马拉松起点位于乔治亚州亚特兰大的Centennial Park（百年公园）。赛道从南部的Grant Park延伸到北部的Piedmont Park（皮德蒙特公园）。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">赛道包括以下地点</strong>：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Five Points（五点），Midtown（市中心），Decatur（迪卡尔），Marietta Street（马里埃塔街），Centennial Olympic Park Drive（百年奥林匹克公园大道），<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Vine City（葡萄城）</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">赛道</strong>设计可以说是诚意满满。这个比赛吸引了大约16,000名参赛选手，算是美国挺大的马拉松了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛日，我们早早的就来到了百年奥林匹克公园大道，天还没有大亮，不过已经是人山人海了！厕所也是一票难求，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">因为我穿了阿森纳的球衣</strong>，还会有人和我打招呼“Gunners go！”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "起点现场 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 005"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "起点人群 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 006"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "起跑拱门 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 007"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这个马拉松因为临近圣帕特里克节，所以主色调是绿色，阿迪达斯赞助的，起点一片绿色的海洋，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">我穿着红色的枪手球衣</strong>，显得格外显眼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "出发前一刻 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 008"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "起点队伍 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 009"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "起点现场 · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 010"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>起跑时间是7点30分，随着时间临近，我也随着大部队逐渐前挪，发令枪响，比赛开始！2023年的第一场全马，正式起跑。2月底的佐治亚早晨，微凉，跑起很舒服。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "起点现场 · 7 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 011"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "起点现场 · 8 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 012"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我们从百年奥林匹克公园出发，一路穿过CNN大楼，在3 mile之后的 Jackson Street Bridge上迎来了城市的天际线。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在谷歌地图上这里有着4.8的评分，当地人说“ 这里是亚特兰大最Instagrammed的地点，也因为大热美剧”行尸走肉”的海报变得更加著名。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "Atlanta Skyline @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 013"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "The Walking · 资料图",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 014"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>4 mile的时候，我们来到著名马丁·路德·金街区，这里是马丁路德金的出生地，如果有机会，可以参观马丁·路德·金的童年住宅。整个街区已被列为历史保护区，以保留邻里的氛围和不同风格的房屋。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "Birth Place @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 015"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "4 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 016"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在这边，我还遇到了一队华人跑者，我和她们说了句”加油！“，大家互相加油鼓气。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "Chinese Runners @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 017"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "5 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 018"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>6 mile之后，会看到一些小朋友在家长的陪同下给跑者们加油鼓气！很棒的文化，当然，在国内，我也遇到过很多次类似的场景，希望也可以早点回国再跑个马。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "6 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 019"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "6 mile · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 020"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在这之后，我们会跑进 Freedom Park，之后9 mile 多一点的时候来到Piedmont Park（皮德蒙特公园）， 这里的 Midtown Reflection 很吸引人， 我也顺手拍了几张照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "Midtown Reflection @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 021"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "Downtown Atlanta @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 022"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>随后我们继续一路沿着十街西行，路过10 mile的英里牌后，终于在11 mile之后迎来的摄影师和补给点。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "10 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 023"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "11 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 024"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>补充了点照片和能量饮料之后，我们即将迎来全马和半马的分界线，这里临近奥林匹克公园，格外的热闹。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "Before Half @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 025"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不过随着半马终点前的一个左转，赛道瞬间安静了下来，下面的旅程只有全马跑者了，不过不用担心，一路上必然少不了欢呼的志愿者，其实也不会很孤单很无聊。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "After Half @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "12 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 027"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "12 mile @Marafoto",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 028"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>14 mile过后，一个庞然大物出现在眼前，那是Mercedes-Benz Stadium （梅赛德斯奔驰体育场），这个体育场于2017年8月开放，是橄榄球联盟（NFL）亚特兰大猎鹰队和美职联（MLS）亚特兰大联队的主场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "14 mile · 志愿者拍摄",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 029"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>该体育场可容纳71,000名观众观看橄榄球比赛，以及42,500名观众观看足球比赛。据说这个体育场花了16亿美元建造，具有可伸缩的屋顶，可以说是超级豪华了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "Mercedes Benz @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 030"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其实跑马的前一天这里正好有亚特兰大联足球队的新赛季开幕比赛，赛前组会会还给大家发邮件，说可以便宜看球。不过时间匆忙，只能以后有机会再去吧，说不定未来可以去看梅西，或者世界杯。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "15 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 031"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>15 mile之后，我们会穿越 Clark Atlanta University （克拉克亚特兰大大学），据说这里是由两所历史悠久的黑人大学克拉克学院（Clark College）和亚特兰大大学（Atlanta University）合并而成。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "Clark Atlanta @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 032"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "Clark Atlanta · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 033"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这里也是我整个赛事最喜欢的路段之一，志愿者们真的太热情了，尖叫声不断。校园里奔跑很舒服，氛围真的超级棒！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "Clark Atlanta · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 034"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 035"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑出校园，我们来了一个U-turn，在17 mile之后，又和梅赛德斯奔驰体育场再度重逢，这边的补给点还有能量胶，我赶紧停下脚步，给自己加加油，补补胶。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "17 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 036"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>吃了能量胶，没多大一会儿，跑起来就不累了，feet也fleet了，就一口气跑到20 mile。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "Energy Gel @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 037"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "20 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 038"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这时候天气热了起来，有一点吃力，说实话亚特兰大马拉松确实不好跑，后半程有数不清的上下坡，每次遇到上坡，我都会想到和Norton的Hill repeat训练，然后就很顺利过坡。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>回头想想，年初的训练确实有效，我觉得跑步其实是个挺”傻“的运动，只要你跑量够了，总能看到效果。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>之后在22 mile的时候，我们还会经过一段很有意思的跑道赛段，好像又回到了在家旁边训练的日子，不过这里的跑道是红色的，不是黑色，少了一些梦回Waggener High School的错觉，后来知道这里叫Track Georgia，当地人很喜欢。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "Track Georgia @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 039"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>23 mile的时候，我看我后面的房子挺好看，就让偶遇了很多次的骑自行车志愿者帮我拍了个照片。之后我们右转，原来奥运五环和火炬就在不远处。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "23 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 040"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "Olympic Five Rings @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 041"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我在补给点喝了点水和能量饮料，看到远处有摄影师，就赶紧跑动起来，怎么也得有点奥运健儿的英姿不是。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "Olympic Five · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Olympic Five · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "Olympic Five · 2 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Olympic Five · 2 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>中途我还和一个很热情的志愿者击掌，她的小女儿也在旁边给我们加油！给大家最后的几个mile注入了满满的能量。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "Wow! @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 044"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "Last Few Miles @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 045"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "Last Few @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 046"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 047"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>剩下的距离反而跑得轻松，我觉得一定是能量胶吃的好，然后冬训也确实认真。在奥林匹克公园边的一路欢呼声中，我轻快的通过了终点，最后成绩 4：26：54。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @Marafoto",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 048"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @Marafoto · 2",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 049"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @Marafoto · 3",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 050"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这算是我来美国后的最好成绩了，有种意犹未尽的感觉：“我还能跑！”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">终点线</span>过后，我还偶遇了另外一位阿森男球迷，我赶紧找他和了一张影，很珍贵的影像。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "Arsenal Fans @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 051"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>47已经到终点有一会了，这会儿正等着我凯旋。我们在彩色奥运五环和奥林匹克公园里找了路人帮我们合影，然后47也给我在摩天轮前拍了一张挺棒的照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "Atlanta Medal @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 052"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "Good Photo @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 053"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "Good Photo · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 054"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛之后，我们徒步走回酒店，取车，回程，≥8个小时。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>亚特兰大的很多交通路线还没有解封，还有很多跑者在陆陆续续完赛。我也打开车窗给他们加油，很巧的是正好看到早晨见过的小哥，他这会也给我比了一个”耶“的手势，我知道他OK的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "Yeah @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 055"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我和47换着开车，一路来到田纳西州的查塔努，找了一家很棒的中餐自助”御花园“，补充了一些能量，接着我们又开到河边，拍下了河边的风景和小城居民悠闲的生活。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "Forbidden City @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 056"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "Chattanooga Tennessee · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 057"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "caption": "Chattanooga Tennessee · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 058"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>回程路过纳什维尔，我们想去DQ吃点shake清爽一下，不过都没有开门。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "caption": "DQ @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 059"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最终，赶在周日的尾巴，我们一路开回路城，洗个澡，睡觉，准备迎接新的一周。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我喜欢这样的周末，相比于身体的稍许疲劳，我更享受这种精神上的愉悦，它总能给我在新的工作生活中带来额外的动力和谈资。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Atlanta-Marathon-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "caption": "5K done @Arsenan",
      "alt": "亚特兰大马拉松照片 060"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑马的疲劳可能一两天就好了，但这种新的motivation却总能持续很久，就比如说，在摸鱼的时候，偶尔翻翻Facebook，我看到98岁的老奶奶Betty Lindberg在同样亚特兰大马拉松比赛中，完成了<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">5公里</span>项目！并且成绩还不到一个小时！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这样的故事总能给人以激励，我也时刻被激励着。</p>"
    }
  ]
}